Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.57,0:01:51.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,With your cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.33,0:01:54.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,how did you get the position of Cloud Sky Sect Leader ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.81,0:02:03.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.89,0:02:06.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,she is my woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.25,0:02:22.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're finally back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.97,0:02:23.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's the Sect Ancestor !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.93,0:02:26.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Sect Ancestor is back !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.33,0:02:28.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's awesome !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.13,0:02:32.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu !?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.29,0:02:33.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,What ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.05,0:02:35.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Sect Ancestor is Ceng Niu ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.53,0:02:37.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ceng Niu who chopped off Red Butterfly's arm,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.65,0:02:38.64,Second,,0,0,0,,it's him !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.17,0:02:40.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you're the one who wants to wipe out the Cloud Sky Sect…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.77,0:02:41.33,Second,,0,0,0,,As expected of the Ancestor !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.49,0:02:42.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng... Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.13,0:02:43.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.61,0:02:45.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were from the Cloud Sky Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.85,0:02:46.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,This time...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.81,0:02:48.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,This time I was reckless !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.81,0:02:49.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Reckless ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.97,0:02:53.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then you will pay the price of your recklessness !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.29,0:03:38.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.49,0:03:40.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,don’t push this bullying too far !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.89,0:03:43.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bully ? Sure, today I'm the one bullying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.93,0:03:52.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fleeing already ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.73,0:04:03.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.73,0:04:06.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've only killed a few low level disciples !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.49,0:04:07.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,There is no death grudge between us !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.21,0:04:11.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.01,0:04:43.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dao of Insects ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.65,0:04:45.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.01,0:04:47.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,insects and beasts
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.77,0:04:49.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,are part of the laws of heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.21,0:04:51.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth are cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.05,0:04:53.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,If humans can eat beasts,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.57,0:04:56.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,then beasts can also eat humans !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.63,0:05:03.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Seal !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.97,0:05:42.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,That fiend is dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.89,0:05:58.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.33,0:06:02.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Liu Fei, Song Qing,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.29,0:06:03.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,seal the sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.69,0:06:04.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,No one is allowed to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.09,0:06:05.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.57,0:06:23.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.29,0:06:25.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,a death aura.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.97,0:06:42.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.29,0:06:47.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling better ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.01,0:06:51.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you still going to leave ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.37,0:06:53.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.25,0:06:55.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Really ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.09,0:06:56.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.65,0:07:01.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.69,0:07:02.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,you need to recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.25,0:07:04.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.25,0:07:19.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.97,0:07:21.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I left 100 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.85,0:07:23.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er was still fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.89,0:07:25.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.73,0:07:28.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Elder Li failed to reach Nascent Soul 3 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.37,0:07:31.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,When she last failed 30 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.53,0:07:33.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,she almost died...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.97,0:07:35.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since then
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.65,0:07:38.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,her health has been deteriorating day by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.93,0:07:44.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I was treating Sect Leader's body,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.89,0:07:49.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,I discovered that she overused her life energy in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.57,0:07:51.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hence the reduction of lifespan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.77,0:07:54.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now that the Sect Leader is at the end of her life,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.37,0:07:57.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,she's been relying on pills to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.49,0:08:00.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,If she was an ordinary Core Formation cultivator,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.97,0:08:02.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,she'd be long dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.61,0:08:05.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Overuse of life energy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.09,0:08:08.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,The power of that jade slip was amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.69,0:08:11.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,So Wan'er used up her lifespan to make it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.81,0:08:13.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er is different from Wang Zhuo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.97,0:08:15.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,He had reached Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.21,0:08:18.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,so I could help him to be reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.65,0:08:20.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,But Wan'er is at the end of her lifespan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.25,0:08:22.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I force her reincarnation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.57,0:08:25.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,she won't be strong enough to avoid the law of heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.69,0:08:27.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.21,0:08:29.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,the only way to save her life
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.57,0:08:31.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,is to have her reach Nascent Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.41,0:08:34.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Liu Fei,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.05,0:08:34.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Song Qing,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.97,0:08:35.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.17,0:08:37.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want to leave with Wan'er.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.69,0:08:39.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,As of today,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.25,0:08:41.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will manage the Cloud Sky Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.33,0:08:43.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understood !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.57,0:08:44.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.67,0:08:45.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,the fact that I am Ceng Niu
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.13,0:08:47.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,must not leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.09,0:08:49.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Find a way to deal with the disciples.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.77,0:08:50.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Ancestor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.29,0:08:53.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll erase their memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.45,0:08:58.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lu Fei is willing to follow Ancestor
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.81,0:09:00.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,to ensure your safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.77,0:09:02.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tie Yan is also willing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.27,0:09:08.43,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1608,511)\fad(300,300)}Snowy canyon\NCountry of Chu's border
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.45,0:09:21.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Zhou Yi's told me that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.89,0:09:24.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,the celestial jade pagoda must be placed in a Yin Energy gathering spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.53,0:09:26.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Celestial's aura
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.41,0:09:30.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,should help Wan'er to temporarily suppress her death aura.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.49,0:09:34.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although there is only a hint of domain in the pagoda,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.89,0:09:37.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,it must not be underestimated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.93,0:09:42.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you Ancestor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.18,0:09:44.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I owe her too much
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.69,0:09:47.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,for all these years I've been gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.69,0:09:50.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.65,0:09:52.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.57,0:09:58.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.53,0:10:00.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Senior's artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.09,0:10:03.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I went to the Celestial Realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.69,0:10:05.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,I got to meet that Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.09,0:10:07.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,He gave it to me before his death
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.01,0:10:10.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,so that I could take care of it for 1000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.29,0:10:14.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Celestial Realm is such a dangerous place...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.85,0:10:15.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,are you alright ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.17,0:10:18.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.25,0:10:20.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.05,0:10:22.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you the whole story.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.89,0:10:27.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.77,0:10:32.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zhou Yi's wife is inside that pagoda...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.01,0:10:35.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,While he's trying to avenge her death...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.85,0:10:38.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wonder how Senior Zhou Yi is after he turned into a Sword Spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.77,0:10:40.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,and went to the Da Lou Sword Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.17,0:10:42.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whatever the outcome,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.09,0:10:45.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,it was all his choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.29,0:10:49.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,I hope his wish comes true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.69,0:10:55.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.25,0:10:57.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,A gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.81,0:11:07.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grade 5 pill recipes !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.73,0:11:11.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,They are so expensive,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.61,0:11:13.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,where did you get them ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.93,0:11:14.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.61,0:11:16.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,after this,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.73,0:11:18.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll get you even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.09,0:11:21.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.81,0:11:29.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.89,0:11:33.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er has a favor to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.89,0:11:34.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.97,0:11:36.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.61,0:11:39.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Soul Bloods of the Cloud Sky Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.69,0:11:42.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,Can you please
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.73,0:11:44.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,help me return it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.13,0:11:49.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that if something happens to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.21,0:11:51.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll get them into trouble again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.21,0:11:53.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,You won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.29,0:11:55.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.65,0:11:57.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,trust me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.77,0:12:00.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will never
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.69,0:12:02.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,let you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.69,0:12:07.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,We will stay here so you can heal in peace,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.25,0:12:08.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.55,0:12:17.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(968,486)\fad(1000,1000)}1 month later
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.01,0:12:33.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,From today onwards,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.17,0:12:34.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,this place
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.41,0:12:36.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be our new home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.13,0:12:41.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.45,0:12:42.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,we went to the Sea of Devils
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.13,0:12:44.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,to confirm that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.49,0:12:46.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,the rank 6 pill that will be auctioned
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.69,0:12:48.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,is a Return to Origin pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.45,0:12:50.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The auction is in 7 days,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.21,0:12:51.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,here is the invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.45,0:12:53.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.49,0:12:54.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,We take our leave then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.49,0:12:56.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.09,0:12:59.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,every Soul Formation cultivator
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.85,0:13:01.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,must understand the heavens in their own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.89,0:13:04.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,The heavens are ruthless,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.61,0:13:06.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,but you need a hint of emotion,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.85,0:13:08.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,at least enough to move your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.97,0:13:11.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,The spiritual energy in your bodies is a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.65,0:13:14.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,The area around this pagoda is the best place for you to train.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.53,0:13:15.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go 50 li away from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.93,0:13:18.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,When you can get close to it with your own cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.57,0:13:20.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will give you two a few more pointers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.13,0:13:23.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you Ancestor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.69,0:13:28.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although the celestial jade pagoda can suppress her death aura,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.57,0:13:30.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's only a temporary solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.17,0:13:33.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I could obtain this grade 6 pill,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.65,0:13:35.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it'll suppress it for good
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.05,0:13:37.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,and restore Wan'er's life energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.37,0:13:41.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,A grade 6 Return to Origin pill is unheard of,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.45,0:13:45.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect its formula to show up in the Sea of Devils.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.21,0:13:47.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll get it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.65,0:13:49.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,so you can reach Nascent Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.65,0:13:51.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior is leaving ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.17,0:13:53.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.77,0:13:54.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,it won't be long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.53,0:13:57.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want to go with you !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.61,0:14:00.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm much better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.73,0:14:01.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's nothing serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.73,0:14:03.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.97,0:14:06.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I cut off Red Butterfly's arm in the Rain Celestial Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.05,0:14:08.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now that I'm back on Suzaku,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.85,0:14:10.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,she will want her revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.89,0:14:12.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,There will be a lot of people there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.45,0:14:14.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,This pagoda
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.85,0:14:16.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,is able to withstand attacks from Ascendant cultivators.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.53,0:14:18.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's safer here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.85,0:14:20.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.09,0:14:24.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't want to leave your side ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.77,0:14:26.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.69,0:14:31.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.97,0:14:35.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,there's another place in the Sea of Devils I have been thinking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.89,0:14:45.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why is the Ancestor so happy today ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.85,0:14:47.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rumor has it that the Sea of Devils
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.29,0:14:49.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,is where Ancestor and Elder Li met.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.37,0:14:51.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a nostalgia trip,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.77,0:14:53.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,of course they'd be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.93,0:14:58.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Fighting Evil Sect !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.29,0:15:05.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,How did this happen ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.13,0:15:14.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,The cave was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.45,0:15:17.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.01,0:15:20.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,The memories of our past
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.29,0:15:22.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,are all gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.85,0:15:27.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.61,0:15:30.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.85,0:15:33.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,The cave is not gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.33,0:15:47.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ancestor
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.81,0:15:50.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,pulled a mountain out of the ground !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.05,0:15:53.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.45,0:15:56.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,the cave is not gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.73,0:16:01.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,An exact copy...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.37,0:16:06.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,You brought me here back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.09,0:16:08.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,saying you want to settle down
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.09,0:16:10.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,and built this cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.17,0:16:15.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I plan to stay in this cave long-term.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.45,0:16:17.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the formation is broken,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.25,0:16:18.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can easily escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.81,0:16:19.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,But you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.97,0:16:21.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,will have to rely on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.73,0:16:26.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.57,0:16:29.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,I made many pills here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.97,0:16:31.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,while waiting for your return.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.33,0:16:35.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,I remember the day you brought back a Flood Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:37.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,I always wanted to ask
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.17,0:16:39.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,how you caught it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.93,0:16:42.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,But you were so cold...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.77,0:16:45.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was afraid to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.09,0:16:48.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.45,0:16:51.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,I waited here for 3 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.41,0:16:53.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect you to come back
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.33,0:16:56.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,with a bunch of people chasing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.69,0:16:59.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,At that time, your formation
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.61,0:17:00.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,was able to stall enough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.89,0:17:03.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,I helped you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.49,0:17:06.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,and then you saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.09,0:17:07.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.49,0:17:10.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,why don't we stay here for a few days ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.45,0:17:12.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.89,0:17:22.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.73,0:17:23.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,what's this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.05,0:17:26.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the Thunder Frog I tamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.45,0:17:28.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was seriously injured
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.05,0:17:30.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,in the Celestial Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.69,0:17:32.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I haven't found a way to cure it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.85,0:17:34.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,These pills I made
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.61,0:17:35.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,are useless to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.25,0:17:37.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I might as well give them to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.73,0:17:45.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,It really worked !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.77,0:19:33.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.89,0:19:34.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.69,0:20:02.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come quick !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.65,0:20:04.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,A late stage Nascent Soul cultivator ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.93,0:20:06.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior, it's an honor
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.17,0:20:07.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,to have you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.01,0:20:09.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,This place is messy,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.05,0:20:11.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,please follow me to the third floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.77,0:20:13.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's no way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.53,0:20:14.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,This time,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.61,0:20:16.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've made lots of preparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.29,0:20:18.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you remember the guy
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.65,0:20:20.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,who bought the recipes a few days ago ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.61,0:20:22.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you think he will come ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.51,0:20:27.24,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1486,505)\fad(300,000)}Zi Xin\NMiddle stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.51,0:20:27.24,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(267,507)\fad(300,000)}Gongsun Fan\NMiddle stage Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.25,0:20:27.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Soul Formation cultivator !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.01,0:20:48.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,This..
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.21,0:20:50.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who is this person ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.29,0:20:52.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hold your tongue,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.57,0:20:54.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,the two guards are both peak Nascent Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.71,0:20:56.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,you don't want to anger them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.79,0:21:02.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,This pill recipe
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.95,0:21:04.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.15,0:21:27.83,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Falling from the night sky and melting into dust\Nlike water without a source.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.90,0:21:33.99,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Like the difference between clouds and mud,\Nthe truth cannot be found in conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.10,0:21:37.93,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Life and death\Nare like the moment when the rain falls
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.96,0:21:41.86,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}and like many other unseparable things.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.22,0:21:47.87,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}In this lifetime,\Nto cultivate the truth, cultivate the world first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.05,0:21:54.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Old grudges had to be settled\Nbecause half an inch is engraved into my tree rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.19,0:22:00.73,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Use the most vivid love and hate\Nto ask questions to your fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.19,0:22:05.41,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Let your eyes be filled enough with rage\Nto pierce the heart and the soul
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.67,0:22:08.90,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}then soften because of the mortals' fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.07,0:22:14.89,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Only when you bend down can you understand\Nthe hidden edge of the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.41,0:22:19.09,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}The human mind is nature,\Nthe rain fell silently like an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.19,0:22:23.01,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Life and death are just moments away,\Nthere are many other solutions to grudges.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.19,0:22:28.86,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Use your dusty heart\Nto depict the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.12,0:22:32.79,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500}One stroke is for killing.\NAfter struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.00,0:22:36.57,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500}One stroke is for caring.\NEverywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.69,0:22:42.61,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Give up your mind to be refined\Nby this endless world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.68,0:22:46.69,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}The human mind is nature,\Nthe rain fell silently like an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.72,0:22:50.51,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Life and death are just moments away,\Nthere are many other solutions to grudges.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.10,0:22:56.34,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Use your dusty heart\Nto depict the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.41,0:23:00.29,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500}One stroke is for killing.\NAfter struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.33,0:23:04.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500}One stroke is for caring.\NEverywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.43,0:23:09.99,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Give up your mind to be refined\Nby this endless world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.63,0:23:16.85,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Snow falls as my hair turns white, winter withers\Nwhile prosperity sprouts in summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.15,0:23:23.65,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}I step into the world, with light at my fingertips,\Nthe law of cause and effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.67,0:23:30.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}I observe the vastness of heaven and earth so I can get rid of evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.54,0:23:37.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Obsession arises from one thought, life and death arise from one thought.\NReincarnation is not to be feared.
